    "searchCoverage": "Official bioRxiv API is unauthenticated. Pinned source treats HTTP 200 bodies whose messages.status is not ok / no posts found / no articles found as errors. Native bodyErrorPaths treat any non-empty string as error, so they cannot whitelist status=ok. There is no authenticated healthcheck. Dated incident search on 2026-09-13 found no qualifying unresolved CSHL/bioRxiv compromise.",
    "incidents": [],
    "remainingGates": [
      "credentials: pinned authTypes are no_auth; there is no stored credential and no cheap authenticated read",
      "HTTP 200 false-success: pinned source fails when messages.status is a string other than ok / no posts found / no articles found. Native bodyErrorPaths cannot invert or whitelist those success strings",
      "live authentication unverified"
    ],
    "waiverAuthority": "User waiver dated 2026-09-13 permits historical non-China incident coverage."
  },
